// Axiom Compiler — MIR Async State-Machine Lowering (compiler/mir/async_lower.ax)
// Transforms `async fn` bodies into structural state machines implementing `Future<Output = T>`.
// Governed by SPEC-33-async.md (AXS-ASY-040..046, REQ-ASY-009, 016, 021, 034, 036, 052, 167, 168).
